## Definition of done

- `greetingInterruption` is typed, synchronously validated when enabled, and disabled by default.
- Omitted and `false` retain the current raw-track runtime, perform no VAD/worklet setup, and have an equivalent static consumer bundle graph with no eager realtime-VAD runtime edge.
