- Normal completion and Skip discard greeting-period audio before live publication.
- Bridge creation, VAD setup, `startAutomaticTurn()`, and `startManualTurn()` failures recover through generation-fenced, gated raw-track replacement without leaking historical audio; an independent replacement failure fails closed.
- Greeting history remains at most once, and post-greeting immediate/transcript-confirmed response arbitration and turn mode remain unchanged.
- Cleanup is exact across success, fallback, partial setup, Skip, disconnect, replacement greeting, and reconnect generations.
- Direct owner, adapter, bundle, race, fallback, post-attachment worklet failure, teardown, docs fixture, default-off, and acoustic-uncertainty coverage is green.
